WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.502
-Hayden, it is so good
to see you, bud.

00:00:02.502 --> 00:00:03.536
-It's good to see you, too, man.

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:04.837
-First time on
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.406
-Yeah, with you, yeah.
-But we've known each other

00:00:07.406 --> 00:00:08.908
for years.

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.210
-I know. We go back to
"The Factory Girl."

00:00:11.210 --> 00:00:13.112
-We were in a movie together
called "Factory Girl"

00:00:13.112 --> 00:00:14.380
with Sienna Miller.

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:15.915
-That's right.
-And you were fantastic.

00:00:15.915 --> 00:00:17.283
We had fun.
-Likewise, yeah.

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:19.285
We had too much fun.
-We actually did, I think.

00:00:19.285 --> 00:00:20.820
Yeah. [ Laughs ]

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:22.955
We actually probably had
too much fun, yeah.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:25.625
Do you remember how impressed
you were by my acting?

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:26.693
You were like,
"Jimmy, you should

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.961
go into the talk show business."

00:00:27.961 --> 00:00:29.362
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.362 --> 00:00:31.330
-I actually, I remember meeting
you for the first time,

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:33.133
and I was playing a character
that was

00:00:33.133 --> 00:00:35.034
loosely based on Bob Dylan,

00:00:35.034 --> 00:00:38.003
and the first time we met,
you went into, you know,

00:00:38.003 --> 00:00:40.273
one of your impersonations
of Bob Dylan.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:42.108
And I was so blown away by it.

00:00:42.108 --> 00:00:43.309
I was like, "Oh, my goodness.

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:45.544
Why aren't you playing
this role?"

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:46.879
-No. Oh, my God, no.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:48.348
You crushed it, come on, man.

00:00:48.348 --> 00:00:52.618
I want to say congrats on the
success of "Obi-Wan Kenobi."

00:00:52.618 --> 00:00:53.753
-Thanks.
-It is the biggest thing

00:00:53.753 --> 00:00:54.954
in the world.

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:56.122
[ Applause ]

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:57.190
And couldn't happen to
a nicer dude.

00:00:57.190 --> 00:00:58.357
-Thank you.

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:00.093
-The finale dropped
on Wednesday.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:01.661
It was trending number one
on Twitter

00:01:01.661 --> 00:01:04.464
for the next three days
after that.

00:01:04.464 --> 00:01:07.133
But first, I want to go back
to talk about

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:10.036
when you first got cast
as Anakin Skywalker.

00:01:10.036 --> 00:01:11.204
-Yeah.

00:01:11.204 --> 00:01:12.472
-You were straight out of
high school, right?

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.941
-Yeah, I was in high school,
like, a year before,

00:01:15.941 --> 00:01:18.611
doing school plays.

00:01:18.611 --> 00:01:20.079
-Where were you?
Like, in Canada?

00:01:20.079 --> 00:01:22.381
-Yeah, I was living in Vancouver
at the time.

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:26.318
It was a long audition process.

00:01:26.318 --> 00:01:30.423
And I was renting an apartment
with a friend of mine,

00:01:30.423 --> 00:01:32.558
and he knew I was
up for this role

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:35.728
and I was gonna be
finding out soon.

00:01:35.728 --> 00:01:39.299
I got the call.
I was shocked, in disbelief.

00:01:39.299 --> 00:01:41.434
I remember walking into
the living room,

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:43.803
just with this, like,
big smile on my face.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:45.772
And he kind of
put the dots together,

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.707
but to confirm it for him,
you know,

00:01:47.707 --> 00:01:49.976
I lit up an imaginary lightsaber
like --

00:01:49.976 --> 00:01:51.443
[ Imitates lightsaber sound ]

00:01:51.443 --> 00:01:53.746
-[ Laughing ] Yes!
-He got it.

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:56.182
-You're like --
-He was a big fan, too.

00:01:56.182 --> 00:01:57.250
-That's great.

00:01:57.250 --> 00:01:59.018
-He had the "Star Wars"
soundtrack,

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.387
and he put the
"Duel of the Fates" on

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:03.322
and we had a whole
lightsaber battle,

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:05.291
sort of jumping all around
our apartment.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:07.627
Just screaming like
giddy little kids.

00:02:07.627 --> 00:02:09.695
-Excited, that's what
it's all about.

00:02:09.695 --> 00:02:10.763
That's so cool.
-It was amazing.

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.131
-All these years later now,

00:02:12.131 --> 00:02:14.433
you're in the new
"Obi-Wan Kenobi."

00:02:14.433 --> 00:02:17.336
You get to really full-on
Darth Vader.

00:02:17.336 --> 00:02:19.138
We had Ewan McGregor
on the show

00:02:19.138 --> 00:02:20.372
a couple weeks ago.

00:02:20.372 --> 00:02:22.675
He said when he first saw you
as Darth Vader,

00:02:22.675 --> 00:02:24.210
he was frightened.

00:02:24.210 --> 00:02:26.880
Like, he actually was
actually scared

00:02:26.880 --> 00:02:29.282
and he was like,
"I felt like, actually,

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:30.115
really frightened.

00:02:30.115 --> 00:02:31.451
Everyone on set, too."

00:02:31.451 --> 00:02:34.854
Do you feel that,
when you wear the costume

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.055
and you dress as Darth Vader?

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:37.390
-Yeah, I mean, you know,

00:02:37.390 --> 00:02:39.859
it's an amazing costume
to get to put on.

00:02:39.859 --> 00:02:42.128
It's an honor to get to wear it.

00:02:42.128 --> 00:02:44.430
But definitely the best part
is just

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:47.366
seeing people's reaction,
you know, when they see Vader.

00:02:47.366 --> 00:02:49.435
You have, like --
-Is it easy to see

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:50.569
out of those eye things?

00:02:50.569 --> 00:02:52.671
-No, I mean, it's very
limited visibly,

00:02:52.671 --> 00:02:55.375
but when someone does come
across your field of vision...

00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:57.210
-They're frightened.
-You see sort of the change

00:02:57.210 --> 00:02:58.878
in their demeanor, you know?

00:02:58.878 --> 00:03:01.180
Like, people who are usually
very confident

00:03:01.180 --> 00:03:04.383
become a little more timid
and shy.

00:03:04.383 --> 00:03:05.751
It's good fun.

00:03:05.751 --> 00:03:07.753
-I wanted to ask, because you're
the only person I can ask.

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:10.456
Does it get hot?
-It's so hot, yeah.

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:12.891
No, you're sweating buckets
in it the whole time.

00:03:12.891 --> 00:03:14.360
-You are, right?
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:19.599
But they actually have, like,
an under component to the suit

00:03:19.599 --> 00:03:22.135
where, if you get too hot,
they plug you into this machine

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:25.337
and it pumps cooling liquid
all around your body

00:03:25.337 --> 00:03:26.639
to sort of cool you down.

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:27.973
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:03:27.973 --> 00:03:31.311
Which, again, sort of aids to
the whole feeling like

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:35.114
you're this mechanical creature
relying on this mechanism.

00:03:35.114 --> 00:03:36.215
-Wow.

00:03:36.215 --> 00:03:37.383
-To keep you going, yeah.

00:03:37.383 --> 00:03:39.185
-That's good to know.
That's cool.

00:03:39.185 --> 00:03:41.521
I know also, when we
first meet you,

00:03:41.521 --> 00:03:44.456
you're very damaged and scarred,
Anakin.

00:03:44.456 --> 00:03:46.359
-I am.
-Great prosthetics for that.

00:03:46.359 --> 00:03:49.061
-Amazing prosthetics.
-How many hours for that?

00:03:49.061 --> 00:03:51.363
-It was like, a good
four to five hours

00:03:51.363 --> 00:03:52.432
every time we did it.

00:03:52.432 --> 00:03:55.000
-And then you have to go act.
-Yeah.

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:58.570
I mean, you know,
it's an amazing visual creation

00:03:58.570 --> 00:04:00.105
that takes place every time
they do it,

00:04:00.105 --> 00:04:03.342
and it really helps you
sort of feel the character.

00:04:03.342 --> 00:04:05.143
But then, end of the day,
when you have to take it off,

00:04:05.143 --> 00:04:06.946
that's a different story.

00:04:06.946 --> 00:04:09.382
-That scrubbing and pulling
and scrubbing, yeah.

00:04:09.382 --> 00:04:11.149
So you're like, alright,
what do I like better,

00:04:11.149 --> 00:04:12.685
that or this hot mask?

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:13.820
You're like, I don't know.

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.053
Yeah.

00:04:15.053 --> 00:04:18.157
By the way, your beautiful
little daughter, 7?

00:04:18.157 --> 00:04:20.692
Did she know that Daddy
is Darth Vader?

00:04:20.692 --> 00:04:23.296
-She knows Daddy's Darth Vader.

00:04:23.296 --> 00:04:25.431
She's never seen Daddy
as Darth Vader.

00:04:25.431 --> 00:04:27.700
I'm still waiting a little bit,
you know,

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:28.868
until that happens.

00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:31.504
-You could probably
show her the...

00:04:31.504 --> 00:04:33.640
-I might show her the prequels
soon.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:34.673
-Yeah.

00:04:34.673 --> 00:04:35.808
-But still, there's some scenes

00:04:35.808 --> 00:04:37.042
we might have to
fast forward through.

00:04:37.042 --> 00:04:38.845
-That's true, yeah.
-But...

00:04:38.845 --> 00:04:40.178
-Does she have a lightsaber?

00:04:40.178 --> 00:04:42.682
-We have a couple lightsabers
kicking around the house,

00:04:42.682 --> 00:04:45.784
and actually, she was my first
lightsaber training partner,

00:04:45.784 --> 00:04:47.286
when I came back to
the "Obi-Wan" show.

00:04:47.286 --> 00:04:48.788
-That's what I'm
talking about, buddy.

00:04:48.788 --> 00:04:50.489
-Yeah.
-The series finale began

00:04:50.489 --> 00:04:52.024
streaming Wednesday,
and I don't want to

00:04:52.024 --> 00:04:54.460
give away any spoilers,
for anyone out there

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.062
who's watching the show
and not caught up.

00:04:56.062 --> 00:04:58.698
It's very interesting,
doing a talk show

00:04:58.698 --> 00:05:00.399
when you're not really allowed
to talk about anything.

00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:01.767
[ Laughter ]

00:05:01.767 --> 00:05:03.135
It happens a lot.

00:05:03.135 --> 00:05:05.004
And then even when it's out,
like,

00:05:05.004 --> 00:05:07.039
it's been out for,
things are out for years

00:05:07.039 --> 00:05:10.943
and they go, "Don't mention
what's happening."

00:05:10.943 --> 00:05:12.544
So just in case people
haven't --

00:05:12.544 --> 00:05:14.913
But this is fresh,
as of Wednesday.

00:05:14.913 --> 00:05:17.517
What can we say about
the finale?

00:05:17.517 --> 00:05:18.650
[ Laughter ]

00:05:18.650 --> 00:05:20.720
-Again, not a lot
without spoiling anything.

00:05:20.720 --> 00:05:22.088
[ Laughter ]
-I knew that!

00:05:22.088 --> 00:05:23.355
I knew that.

00:05:23.355 --> 00:05:25.024
-But no, there's some
great stuff,

00:05:25.024 --> 00:05:28.894
and there's a very
emotional confrontation

00:05:28.894 --> 00:05:31.597
between Obi-Wan and Vader

00:05:31.597 --> 00:05:35.101
that was a real sort of
privilege to get to film.

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:37.436
-With Ewan?
-With Ewan, yeah.

00:05:37.436 --> 00:05:39.738
-He's a great guy.
He's a great actor.

00:05:39.738 --> 00:05:41.640
-I love the man to bits, yeah.

00:05:41.640 --> 00:05:43.008
-Yeah, it's good.

00:05:43.008 --> 00:05:44.811
It does get very kind of
emotional.

00:05:44.811 --> 00:05:46.979
Congrats again on everything,
buddy.

00:05:46.979 --> 00:05:48.114
You know I love you, man.

00:05:48.114 --> 00:05:49.882
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:49.882 --> 00:05:50.950
I want to show everyone a clip.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:53.252
Here's Hayden Christensen
and Ewan McGregor

00:05:53.252 --> 00:05:54.486
in "Obi-Wan Kenobi."

00:05:54.486 --> 00:05:55.621
Take a look at this.

00:05:55.621 --> 00:05:57.723
[ Whirring ]

00:05:57.723 --> 00:05:59.191
-I do not fear the Dark Side!

00:05:59.191 --> 00:06:01.627
I see through the lies
of the Jedi.

00:06:01.627 --> 00:06:07.632 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:07.632 --> 00:06:09.969
-Help me, Master Qui-Gon.

00:06:09.969 --> 00:06:11.637
Give me strength.

00:06:11.637 --> 00:06:15.074 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:15.074 --> 00:06:16.509
[ Beeping ]

00:06:16.509 --> 00:06:19.612 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:19.612 --> 00:06:23.115
-Anakin Skywalker is alive.

00:06:23.115 --> 00:06:31.256 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:31.256 --> 00:06:34.226
He's been looking for you
for a long time.

00:06:34.226 --> 00:06:38.263 line:0%
♪♪

00:06:38.263 --> 00:06:40.533
[ Deep, labored breath ]

00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:42.768
[ Applause ]
-Yes! Come on!

00:06:42.768 --> 00:06:44.870
Hayden Christensen, everybody!

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:49.508
"Obi-Wan Kenobi" is streaming
now on Disney Plus.

00:06:49.508 --> 00:06:51.810
Preacher Lawson is performing
stand-up after the break.

00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:52.912
Stick around, everybody.

